{
  "name": "Seven Content Radar — Scheduler (07:00 / 13:00 / 19:00 / 23:00 Paris)",
  "flow": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "module": "http:ActionSendData",
      "version": 3,
      "parameters": { "handleErrors": true, "useNewZLibDeCompress": true },
      "mapper": {
        "url": "{{RADAR_BASE_URL}}/jobs/tick",
        "method": "post",
        "headers": [{ "name": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{RADAR_JOBS_SECRET}}" }],
        "qs": [],
        "bodyType": "raw",
        "contentType": "application/json",
        "data": "{\"reason\":\"schedule\"}",
        "parseResponse": true,
        "timeout": "40",
        "shareCookies": false,
        "followRedirect": true,
        "followAllRedirects": false,
        "rejectUnauthorized": true,
        "useMtls": false
      },
      "metadata": {
        "designer": { "x": 0, "y": 0 },
        "restore": {},
        "expect": [
          { "name": "url", "type": "url", "label": "URL", "required": true },
          { "name": "method", "type": "select", "label": "Method" },
          { "name": "headers", "type": "array", "label": "Headers" },
          { "name": "bodyType", "type": "select", "label": "Body type" },
          { "name": "data", "type": "buffer", "label": "Request content" }
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "metadata": {
    "instant": false,
    "version": 1,
    "scenario": {
      "roundtrips": 1,
      "maxErrors": 3,
      "autoCommit": true,
      "autoCommitTriggerLast": true,
      "sequential": false,
      "confidential": false,
      "dataloss": false,
      "dlq": false,
      "freshVariables": false
    },
    "designer": { "orphans": [] },
    "zone": "eu1.make.com",
    "notes": [
      "Planification : onglet Scheduling du scénario → 'Every day' → heures 07:00, 13:00, 19:00, 23:00, fuseau Europe/Paris.",
      "Remplacer {{RADAR_BASE_URL}} par l'URL standby de l'Actor Apify (https://<actor>.apify.actor) et {{RADAR_JOBS_SECRET}} par le secret RADAR_JOBS_SECRET (à stocker dans une variable de scénario ou un Custom Variable Make, jamais en clair dans une note).",
      "Le digest quotidien et le rapport hebdomadaire sont déclenchés automatiquement par le tick de 07:00 (lundi pour l'hebdo) — aucun scénario supplémentaire nécessaire."
    ]
  }
}
